# Garruk, Curse Breaker's +2 is "untap up to two target lands": on turn 1 it untaps one tapped Forest (one target is allowed), which
# then pays for an Elvish Mystic; the Mystic enters with power 1, so the "power 4 or greater" draw trigger does not fire
# (the control that it does is garruk-curse-breaker-minus-three-makes-a-trampling-beast-and-draws-for-it). On turn 3 both
# Forests, tapped for mana, are untapped by a second +2 with two targets. Loyalty 5 + 2 + 2 = 9; hand 7 - 5 plays = 2, +1 draw
# on turn 3, -1 for the second Forest.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Elvish Mystic
Garruk, Curse Breaker
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

